  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心製作。大量活躍模組支援 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 平台！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">隨機村莊名稱是一個能為世界中所有村莊隨機賦予預設清單中名稱的模組。此名稱透過村莊中央的一個告示牌顯示，更多相關細節請參閱 Areas 的說明。它能為你的世界增添更多沉浸感。你可以移除告示牌並重新命名，或在其原位置放置空白告示牌來完全移除名稱。<br><br>Areas 模組提供特定設定選項，例如可移除顯示文字中的「進入」部分。<br><br>你也可以移除自動生成的告示牌，並放置自訂告示牌。只需確保它位於自動告示牌周圍 15 個方塊的半徑內。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/areas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/areas.svg\" alt=\"需要 Areas\" width=\"211\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum 的 RPG 組合包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg\" alt=\"環境：用戶端與伺服器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/commands.svg\" alt=\"指令\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/areas</em> - 顯示玩家周圍所有包含村莊名稱的區域告示牌。</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/random-village-names/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"555\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">一個由中央告示牌命名的村莊：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/random-village-names/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"578\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/random-village-names/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"578\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/random-village-names/d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，只要下載檔案仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系內即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留言功能已關閉，因為我無法在這麼多獨立模組頁面中追蹤它們。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如需回報問題、提供想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
